   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLH301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 6 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14402 · Decision 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 07/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GLH301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>6 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14402 · QĐ 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 07/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Explain the fundamental concepts of goods and insurance in commercial, transport, and logistics activities, including the characteristics, classification, packaging, marking, storage, and risk exposure of goods.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Identify and classify different types of goods, especially dangerous goods, based on their characteristics, hazardous properties, and relevant transport requirements in logistics operations.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Apply international regulations and standard procedures related to the transport of goods, including the classification, packing, marking, labelling, and documentation requirements for dangerous goods shipments.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Analyze the roles, responsibilities, and training requirements of the parties involved in the transport and transit chain in order to ensure compliance and safety in goods handling and transportation.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Apply the principal concepts of cargo insurance, including insurable interest, indemnity, subrogation, marine risks, and types of losses, to assess risk exposure and determine suitable insurance protection for different categories of goods.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Evaluate cargo loss or damage situations and perform appropriate actions, including selecting suitable insurance cover under Institute Cargo Clauses (A), (B), and (C), preparing transport documentation, and handling insurance claims effectively.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14402</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14402</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
